{"data":{"id":"\/api\/vBeta\/products\/584455","type":"Product","attributes":{"image":"23458\/584455.png","webImage":"23458\/584455.webp","thumbnail":"23458\/584455-thumb140.png","thumbnail200":"23458\/584455-thumb200.webp","thumbnail100":"23458\/584455-thumb100.png","thumbnail80":"23458\/584455-thumb80.png","thumbnail40":"23458\/584455-thumb40.png","price":8.99,"fileLastModified":"2026-09-16T13:55:57-05:00","dateAvailable":"2026-09-28T19:34:50-05:00","status":true,"enabled":"enabled","sortPriority":9999,"publisherId":23458,"specialPrice":null,"sku":"","authors":["Aaron Pollyea","Al Spader","The Yellow Hand"],"artists":["Jay Sojdelius","The Yellow Hand"],"editors":[],"contributors":[],"edition":null,"promoText":"","contentRating":0,"aiStatus":1,"rating":"0.0","isAudio":false,"isVideo":false,"isPwyw":false,"isCommunityContent":false,"lowestDigitalPrice":8.99,"lowestPrintPrice":13.99,"lowestAnyPrice":null,"dateCreated":"2026-09-28T19:34:50-05:00","dateModified":"2026-09-29T07:19:08-05:00","workflowStatus":"created","productId":584455,"description":{"name":"Redacted – 1950s Sourcebook","description":"\u003Cdiv\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022h1\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EREDACTED – A SAUCER SQUADRON RPG\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E:\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E1950s SOURCEBOOK\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan\u003EThe Redacted 1950s Sourcebook \u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cspan\u003Eis an 80-page sourcebook for the Redacted role-playing game, containing information for the GM to set campaigns and scenarios in this decade. The book describes the history of the era, the alien X-Tech available to humanity, the state of the nations of Earth in the space race at this time, new rules for character generation, new equipment, an exciting full-length mission, and several mission briefs. In addition, the book contains information about the space forces and the saucers of this period, for use with the companion boardgame Saucer Squadron. \u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan\u003EThe full-length mission in the sourcebook, \u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cspan\u003EEarth vs. the Radioactive Roaches\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E, is also released separately, for those who prefer to purchase it as a standalone. Check out the mission \u003C\/span\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/www.drivethrurpg.com\/en\/product\/584453\/redacted-earth-vs-the-radioactive-roaches\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022nofollow noreferrer noopener\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan\u003Ehere\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E.\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/www.drivethrurpg.com\/images\/23458\/_product_images\/584455\/Product-Cover_SS-8a.png\u0022 width=\u0022500\u0022 height=\u0022495\u0022 alt=\u0022Alien threat\u0022 title=\u0022Alien threat\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EALIEN THREAT\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/www.drivethrurpg.com\/images\/23458\/_product_images\/584455\/Product-Cover_SS-8b.png\u0022 width=\u0022500\u0022 height=\u0022495\u0022 alt=\u0022Earth\u0027s Defenses\u0022 title=\u0022Earth\u0027s Defenses\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEARTH\u0027S DEFENSES\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/www.drivethrurpg.com\/images\/23458\/_product_images\/584455\/Product-Cover_SS-8c.png\u0022 width=\u0022500\u0022 height=\u0022495\u0022 alt=\u0022Political Intrigue\u0022 title=\u0022Political Intrigue\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPOLITICAL INTRIGUE\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/www.drivethrurpg.com\/images\/23458\/_product_images\/584455\/Product-Cover_SS-8d.png\u0022 width=\u0022500\u0022 height=\u0022495\u0022 alt=\u0022Character Options\u0022 title=\u0022Character Options\u0022 \/\u0